\section{Requirements}
The program downloads almost all of the necessary data from the internet, but data from the World Bank is currently read from local files, so the path to these needs to be set in the variable \texttt{country.data.path} which should be a path to the \emph{directory} where the following files reside:

\begin{itemize}
\item "API\_NY.GDP.PCAP.CD\_DS2\_en\_excel\_v2\_5795829.xlsx"
\item "API\_NE.EXP.GNFS.ZS\_DS2\_en\_excel\_v2\_5728793.xlsx"
\item "API\_NV.AGR.TOTL.ZS\_DS2\_en\_excel\_v2\_5728821.xlsx"
\item "API\_SP.POP.1564.TO\_DS2\_en\_excel\_v2\_5731200.xlsx"
\end{itemize}

<<setup.more>>=
